_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":653,"digest":"sha256:7d2b3d065360d0c280e601400f145e8ea8a0971be5dc8be0884904478ca65aa8","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-18T04:01:13Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:01:13Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/releases/download/m135-v0.13.5/m13stage5-starter-manifest.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/tarball/m135-v0.13.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enginsoysal/engacer-os/zipball/m135-v0.13.5","body":"# Engacer OS M13.5 / 0.13.5 - Desktop and window experience\n\nNative qualification passes M13-STAGE5-VM-v1. This scoped release refines the desktop and window experience while preserving existing storage and application behavior. Read the [desktop/window guide](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/e441c6a39b64fa4486226f0a35f43b2c6b2124db/docs/handbook/desktop-m135.md) and [installation/recovery guide](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/e441c6a39b64fa4486226f0a35f43b2c6b2124db/docs/handbook/install-m135.md). M13.6-M13.12 remain separate ordered deliveries.\n\nBuild: `57c2d93b6a9b2cc3578c4e606751629f`.\nISO SHA256: `cca77e50c8ef92da043467141a8ef1b6e9f1fb16043339bd28824afd014ee90f`.\nVMware ZIP SHA256: `4cf77230c4f8db874b33d1f0be2491e4e743c3a72e3e0180d1a2355f792b165a`.\n\n## Native changes\n\nAn original folded-light wallpaper replaces the flat default presentation without loading another image or retaining another framebuffer. Solid and Horizon remain available; high contrast stays plain black. The desktop name banner is removed, the shared icon grid begins near the top and label backings preserve readability over customized colors. Longer-name feedback has a reserved strip above desktop paging, with matching damage tracking.\n\nWindow frames use restrained active/inactive hairlines with stronger high-contrast boundaries. Caption hit areas, ownership, tooltips and dirty-work reviews remain authoritative. Edge feedback describes the actual proposed rectangle and how to apply it. Odd-width right halves use the remaining screen width. Keyboard Move no longer mistakes an off-screen virtual grip for a real pointer at the right edge; explicit Win+Left/Right remain snap commands.\n\n## Exact native qualification\n\n[Acceptance](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/e441c6a39b64fa4486226f0a35f43b2c6b2124db/evidence/M13/5/acceptance-results.json), [resources](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/e441c6a39b64fa4486226f0a35f43b2c6b2124db/evidence/M13/5/resources.json) and [visual review](https://github.com/enginsoysal/engacer-os/blob/e441c6a39b64fa4486226f0a35f43b2c6b2124db/evidence/M13/5/visual-review.json) bind 603 compiled inputs and 62 native task/profile checks. Five display/control/install profiles cover ordinary, compact, 1024x768, 150% and physical 4K/200%. Six window journeys include those profiles plus actual 2048x1152 at 150%, whose logical width is 1365 pixels. Real left/right placement, independent normal-bound restoration, pointer move/resize cancellation, dirty editor text, off-screen keyboard recovery and two disk-only starts pass.\n\nA separate desktop journey creates 43 real folders to exercise paging, keyboard neighbors, long-name feedback, shortcuts/recycling, hidden built-in references and persistence. Seventeen original-vector comparisons across 48/72/96 physical icon sizes match the actual native pixels. Caption tests exercise hover/press/focus, all eight resize edges/corners, owner-bound reviews and light/dark/HiDPI frames. Twelve cached movement captures equal complete native viewport repaints across ordinary, 150% and physical 4K scenes.\n\nThe exact enabled-device SATA/UEFI VMware starter performs real installation, retained-ISO startup, maximize/restore and Settings, followed by two disk-only starts. Its scope is separate from M13.4's older fourteen-controller matrix. The original failed keyboard-snap candidate and earlier observation-command attempts remain excluded diagnostics. A Settings preview is correctly cancelled on close; the qualified scale journey explicitly applies its choice before closing.\n\n## Resources and limits\n\nMeasured fixed desktop state is 553,436 bytes, 16 bytes below M13.4; fixed installer state stays 48,412 bytes. Immutable font masks remain 251,248 bytes. Named tasks retain zero managed pages and idle CPUs halt. Configured RAM, framebuffers and managed current/peak/retained pages are separate. Wallpaper has no new cache, worker, timer or retained pixel buffer.\n\nCached-move host event-to-drain observations include instrumentation and are not FPS, display refresh or M13.9 latency qualification. Actual motion targets remain separately measured in M13.9. Whole-disk installation and explicit erasure guards remain. Secure Boot signing, universal/physical hardware, vendor GPU 3D and general Windows compatibility remain outside this stage. Agent scenario/visual review is separate from human novice research.\n"}